      <h2>What he speaks on</h2>
      <p>Lou speaks and gives interviews on growing up inside the SSPX, the 2026 consecrations and excommunications, high-control religious movements and how families come through them, and the writing of <em>Traddyland</em>. He is available for podcasts, print and broadcast interviews, parish and university events, and book clubs, in person in New York and by video anywhere.</p>
